DESCRIPTION:The City of Mississauga and the Streetsville Historical Society Celebrate the Leslie Log House 200 Years and the Opening of our new exhibit\, The William Couse Restored Carriage \nSpecial invited guests and speakers\,  Tea room\, Art in the Park\, Games for the children\, Tree planting and bench placing in honor of the occasion. Free admission* \n*We accept food donations to “Giving without expectation” food table in Streetsville \nFor more information please contact:416-799-6223
